This film record of the historical event shows in dramatic detail the various phases of the epochal experiment, from takeoff to the awful blast that destroyed or damaged more than half the ships in Bikini Lagoon.\" scenes of Admiral William H. Blandy commanding Operation Crossroads at Bikini Lagoon, test animals put on ships, sheep is sheared, Secretary of Navy Forrestal speaks on deck of ship (sound distorted), crews leave, Bikini fleet ready, A-bomb loaded on B-29 Dave's Dream, plane takes off, bomb doors open, men put on protective goggles; (2) \"The bomb's away! It's falling . . . \" then explosion, \"motion picture spectacle of all time\" and another view of the explosion. (complete newsreel)","title":"First Pictures Atomic Blast!,  1946/07/08","publisher":"Universal Studios","collection":["universal_newsreels","newsandpublicaffairs"],"mediatype":"movies","uploader":"skipe@mindspring.com","color":"b&w","sound":"sound","addeddate":"2005-05-31 08:37:42","adder":"AV Geek Skip","date":"1946","type":"MovingImage","identifier":"1946-07-08_First_Pictures_Atomic_Blast","licenseurl":"http://creativecommons.org/licenses/publicdomain/","publicdate":"2005-05-31 13:12:32","updater":["unix:movies","PaulForrest"],"updatedate":"2005-11-02 12:40:45","backup_location":"ia903600_8","closed_captioning":"no"},"reviews":[{"reviewbody":"Thank god foe F.D.R.","reviewtitle":"uglygeorge F U","stars":"5","reviewer":"Boss","createdate":"2005-09-14 17:11:14","reviewdate":"2005-09-14 17:11:14"},{"reviewbody":"Fear on a few faces but otherwise sanity prevails ... contrary to some beliefs.  Gullible people used to accept whatever the news reported?  Animal testing:  Inhumane!  Gratuitous explosions accompanied by an upbeat commentary.  Surreal.","reviewtitle":"Real Surreal Newsreel","stars":"4","reviewer":"mindrec","createdate":"2005-10-09 17:19:32","reviewdate":"2005-10-09 17:19:32"},{"reviewbody":"Hey, there were sailors on ships outside the ring of test ships there were sailors who watched this stupid test being performed only 1 sailor from the arkansaw lived becaused he went AWOL from day 2 test MY STORY IS CORRECT and I got a purple heart that belonged to my uncle from this YOU BELEIVE EVERYTHING THE GOVERMENT TELLS YOU","reviewtitle":"mark postle","reviewer":"airmarkpostle","reviewdate":"2008-06-18 01:52:32","createdate":"2008-05-17 03:01:16","stars":"0"},{"reviewbody":"To the person who wrote the last review, THERE WAS NO ONE ON BOARD THE SHIPS WHEN THE BLASTS WENT OFF. THE BOMB ON THE \"SECOND DAY\" YOU SPOKE OF WAS DETONATED UNDERWATER, NOT \"DROPPED OFF COURSE\". I think you need to get your story straight.","reviewtitle":"WHAT?","reviewer":"tsk1234","reviewdate":"2008-05-18 22:36:03","createdate":"2008-05-18 22:36:03","stars":"0"},{"reviewtitle":"DOES ANY BODY NOTICE?","reviewbody":"If this is the FIRST Reel from Atomic Blast, then the Hiroshima and Nagasaki Blast Reels must be Fake.","stars":"5","reviewer":"DILIMON","reviewdate":"2021-01-10 20:50:21","createdate":"2021-01-10 20:50:21","reviewer_itemname":"@dilimon"}],"server":"dn600207.us.archive.org","simplelists":{"solo_manifest":{"solo_manifest_dn600207":{"sys_changed_by":{"source":"task","task_id":"5408955024"},"sys_last_changed":"2026-06-01 16:13:19.171847"}}},"solo":true,"uniq":1322858558,"workable_servers":["dn600207.us.archive.org"]}